 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of the respective endpoints of the image are ${R}^{′}(2,0)$ and ${S}^{′}(-1,-1).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-281528/field-1" "q-281528/field-2" "q-281528/field-3" "q-281528/field-4"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "85936915-4c9c-572c-af99-025fec0f7570"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-281528"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-281560/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "edf47467-7a93-5812-abe6-ea6e1e049c91" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-281560/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "4f54617d-ba6d-51b8-b3c0-1708b058b924" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-281560/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer-field/choices ["q-281560/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-281560/field-2/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa" :answer/id #uuid "b9c6231a-3809-5f35-9e61-d8b58e43c77f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-281560/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "f35fa5af-d22a-5874-a880-3e5df10ea1f8" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-281560/field-2/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa" :answer-field/choices ["q-281560/field-2/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-281560/field-3/650efaaa01beaa7de6c030497edff1dd29c570bf683f3726bbcacabc3dfa7e4c" :answer/id #uuid "093a9a28-9db2-