/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-281560/field-6" :answer-field/id #uuid "b07dbe96-f4e3-54b3-a9a9-ffb06a0b19fc" :answer-field/key "field-6" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-281560/field-6/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af" :answer-field/choices ["q-281560/field-6/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-281560" :question/id #uuid "2717d20d-beb3-545b-9060-dea831bd6940" :question/math-academy-id "q-281560" :question/problem "Consider the linear transformation $T$ with matrix representation $T,$ given by\n\n$$\nT=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nA triangle $PQR$ has vertices at $P(1,3),\\,Q(5,-1),$ and $R(-2,4).$ What are the coordinates of the corresponding vertices of  $△{P}^{′}{Q}^{′}{R}^{′}$, the image of $△PQR$ under the action of $T?$\n\n${P}^{′}($ \n{{field-1}}, \n{{field-2}}\n$),\\,$  $\\,{Q}^{′}($ \n{{field-3}}, \n{{field-4}}\n$),\\,$ $\\,{R}^{′}($ \n{{field-5}}, \n{{field-6}}\n$)$" :question/worked-solution "To find the image of $△PQR$ under the action of $T$, we first create a matrix $X$ containing all of the vertices of $PQR:$\n\n$$\nX=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 5 & -2 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the image of $X$ under $T$ by calculating the matrix product $TX:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}TX & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 & 5 & -2 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & 16 & -10 \\\\ 6 & -2 & 8\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of the respective vertices of $△{P}^{′}{Q}^{′}{R}^{′}$ are ${P}^{′}(0,6),$\n${Q}^{′}(16,-2),$ ${R}^{′}(-10,8).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-281560/field-1" "q-281560/field-2" "q-281560/field-3" "q-281560/field-4" "q-281560/field-5" "q-281560/field-6"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7c9849b9-397b-5fb9-bb4b-01f3d013c5c2"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-281560"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
